{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"香港國際電腦會議一連兩日在會展舉行\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/COMPUTER-PC-261109-11.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】香港國際電腦會議一連兩日在灣仔會展舉行。</p><p>創新科技及工業局局長孫東等人出席開幕典禮，會議由香港電腦學會主辦，期間會舉行多場會議，並邀請世界各地資訊及通訊科技專家、商界領袖及學者等人士交流，將會討論「人工智能+」，為香港社會經濟，以及資訊科技行業帶來的競爭優勢等議題。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.411205+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T03:43:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.153573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:41.346496+00:00","content_hash":"e8144e6f140b212d4901fe8aa092da08e6f17648a6c6b490201ccc054f2cadd1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.411205+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}